<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-HK">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>{{ title }}</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", "PingFang HK", "Microsoft JhengHei", sans-serif;
           color: #222; max-width: 920px; margin: 32px auto; padding: 0 16px; line-height: 1.6; }
    h1 { color: #1f4e79; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    h2 { color: #1f4e79; border-bottom: 2px solid #e3eaf2; padding-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 32px; }
    h3 { color: #555; margin-top: 24px; }
    .meta { color: #888; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .commentary { background: #f5f8fb; border-left: 4px solid #1f4e79;
                  padding: 12px 16px; margin: 12px 0; }
    .commentary ul { margin: 4px 0; padding-left: 20px; }
    .alert { background: #fff3e0; border-left: 4px solid #f57c00;
             padding: 12px 16px; margin: 12px 0; }
    table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 12px 0; font-size: 14px; }
    th, td { padding: 8px 10px; text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid #e3eaf2; }
    th { background: #f0f4f8; }
    td.num { text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
    .pos { color: #2e7d32; font-weight: 500; }
    .neg { color: #c62828; font-weight: 500; }
    .muted { color: #888; }
    img.chart { display: block; margin: 12px 0; max-width: 100%; }
    .disclaimer { background: #fff8e1; border: 1px solid #f0d27a; padding: 12px 16px;
                  font-size: 12px; color: #6b5300; margin-top: 32px; border-radius: 4px; }
    .badge { display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 10px;
             background: #e3eaf2; color: #1f4e79; font-size: 11px; margin-right: 4px; }
    .badge-theme { background: #ffe0b2; color: #b35900; }
    .portfolio-card { background: #fafbfd; border: 1px solid #e3eaf2; border-radius: 6px;
                      padding: 16px 18px; margin: 16px 0; }
    .portfolio-card h3 { margin-top: 0; color: #1f4e79; }
    .weight-bar { background: #1f4e79; height: 18px; border-radius: 3px; display: inline-block;
                  vertical-align: middle; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
  <div class="meta">生成時間 {{ generated_at }} · 回顧期 {{ lookback_days }} 日 · 追蹤基金 {{ fund_count }} 隻</div>

  {% block content %}{% endblock %}

  <div class="disclaimer">
    <strong>免責聲明。</strong>本報告基於公開市場數據生成，內容屬市場觀察及量化信號，
    <strong>不構成任何個人化投資建議或買賣指令</strong>。過往表現不代表將來業績。
    所有向客戶提出嘅建議須由持牌投資顧問依當地法規覆核及簽署後方可執行。
  </div>
</body>
</html>
